  "reason": "A warm orange primary paired with a deep green secondary signals food and sustainability, while the small palette keeps the mobile PWA clean, legible and consistent with a logo-driven identity.",
  "design_html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n:root {\n  --background: 156.0 14.3% 6.9%;\n  --foreground: 140.0 14.3% 95.9%;\n  --card: 133.3 16.4% 10.8%;\n  --card-foreground: 140.0 14.3% 95.9%;\n  --popover: 133.3 16.4% 10.8%;\n  --popover-foreground: 140.0 14.3% 95.9%;\n  --primary: 159.5 58.3% 40.4%;\n  --primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --secondary: 161.7 45.1% 20.0%;\n  --secondary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n  --muted-foreground: 148.4 9.1% 59.0%;\n  --accent: 36.1 87.6% 59.0%;\n  --accent-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n  --destructive: 2.6 75.3% 63.5%;\n  --destructive-foreground: 0 0% 100%;\n  --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n  --ring: 159.5 58.3% 40.4%;\n  --radius: 0.5rem;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.06);\n  --shadow: 0 4px 12px -2px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.10);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 12px 32px -8px hsl(var(--foreground) / 0.14);\n}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));font-family:'Manrope',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"am\"> <style>.am{background:hsl(var(--background));color:hsl(var(--foreground));min-height:100%;line-height:1.5}.am *{box-sizing:border-box}.am-nav{position:sticky;top:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 3rem;background:hsl(var(--card));border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.am-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700}.am-logo{width:2rem;height:2rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));display:grid;place-items:center}.am-links{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;font-size:.875rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.am-links a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.am-links a:hover{color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.am-actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}.am-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.625rem 1.125rem;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}.am-btn-p{background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.am-btn-o{background:transparent;border-color:hsl(var(--border));color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.am-btn-lg{padding:.8rem 1.5rem;font-size:1rem}.am-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center;padding:5rem 3rem 4rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,hsl(var(--primary) / 0.08),hsl(var(--background)))}.am-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.3rem .75rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600}.am-hero h1{font-size:3.25rem;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;margin:1.25rem 0 1rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}.am-lede{font-size:1.125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));max-width:36rem}.am-cta{display:flex;gap:.75rem;margin-top:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.am-proof{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;margin-top:2rem;font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.am-proof b{display:block;font-size:1.25rem;color:hsl(var(--foreground))}.am-card{background:hsl(var(--card));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:1.5rem}.am-hcard{box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}.am-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem}.am-meta{font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}code{font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.am-badge{display:inline-block;padding:.2rem .6rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--secondary));font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600}.am-badge-p{background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary))}.am-match{margin-top:1rem;padding:.875rem;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 2px);background:hsl(var(--muted));font-size:.8125rem}.am-match ul{margin:.5rem 0 0;padding-left:1.1rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.am-h3{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:700;margin:.75rem 0 .25rem}.am-sec{padding:4.5rem 3rem}.am-sec-alt{background:hsl(var(--muted) / 0.5);border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-bottom:1px solid hsl(var(--border))}.am-eyebrow{font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;color:hsl(var(--primary));text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.am-sec h2{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;margin:.5rem 0 .5rem;letter-spacing:-.01em}.am-sub{color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));max-width:40rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.am-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem}.am-ico{width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - 2px);background:hsl(var(--primary) / 0.1);color:hsl(var(--primary));display:grid;place-items:center}.am-p{font-size:.9375rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:0}.am-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:start}.am-check{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;margin-top:1rem}.am-check div{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;font-size:.9375rem}.am-tick{width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--primary));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground));display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}.am-input{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:.7rem .9rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:hsl(var(--background));border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));font-size:.9375rem;margin-top:.5rem}.am-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:2rem}.am-stat{font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:.25rem 0}.am-bar{height:.5rem;border-radius:9999px;background:hsl(var(--muted));overflow:hidden;margin-top:1rem}.am-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:hsl(var(--primary))}.am-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:2rem 3rem;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border));background:hsl(var(--card));font-size:.8125rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground))}.am-foot nav{display:flex;gap:1.25rem}</style> <nav class=\"am-nav\"> <div class=\"am-brand\"><span class=\"am-logo\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M12 21c-5 0-8-3.5-8-8 4 0 8 2 8 8zM12 21c0-6 3-10 9-11 0 6-3 11-9 11z\"/></svg></span>Anna Mitra</div> <div class=\"am-links\"><a href=\"#\">Donors</a><a href=\"#\">NGOs</a><a href=\"#\">Volunteers</a><a href=\"#\">CSR impact</a><a href=\"#\">How it works</a></div> <div class=\"am-actions\"><a class=\"am-btn am-btn-o\" href=\"#\">Log in</a><a class=\"am-btn am-btn-p\" href=\"#\">Get started</a></div> </nav> <header class=\"am-hero\"> <div> <span class=\"am-kicker\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg>Live in 42 districts this week</span> <h1>Surplus food reaches people tonight, not in the bin.</h1> <p class=\"am-lede\">Anna Mitra lets restaurants post surplus food in under a minute, matches it to nearby NGOs, coordinates volunteer pickup, and reports only confirmed rescue impact.</p> <div class=\"am-cta\"><a class=\"am-btn am-btn-p am-btn-lg\" href=\"#\">Post a donation</a><a class=\"am-btn am-btn-o am-btn-lg\" href=\"#\">Find food as an NGO</a></div> <div class=\"am-proof\"><div><b>184,520</b>confirmed portions</div><div><b>3.1 t</b>waste avoided this month</div><div><b>11 min</b>median claim time</div></div> </div> <div class=\"am-card am-hcard\"> <div class=\"am-row\"><span class=\"am-badge am-badge-p\">Claimed · 2 of 3 portions</span><code>DN-2407-LM</code></div> <h3 class=\"am-h3\">Vegetable biryani, 18 portions</h3> <p class=\"am-meta\">Pickup by 21:30 · Rooftop Kitchen, 1.2 km away</p> <div class=\"am-match\"><strong>Why this matched you</strong> <ul><li>Within your 3 km pickup radius</li><li>Vegetarian, matches your current need</li><li>Your van has capacity for 20 portions</li></ul></div> <div class=\"am-row\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><span class=\"am-meta\">Volunteer: Ravi, 2 seats free</span><a class=\"am-btn am-btn-p\" href=\"#\">Claim 12 portions</a></div> </div> </header> <section class=\"am-sec\"> <p class=\"am-eyebrow\">Built for every hand in the rescue</p> <h2>One platform, five roles, zero guesswork</h2> <p class=\"am-sub\">Each participant sees only what they need to act: donors post fast, NGOs claim what fits, volunteers carry it, admins keep things safe.</p> <div class=\"am-grid\"> <div class=\"am-card\"><div class=\"am-ico\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M12 4v16\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"am-h3\">Donors: post in one tap</h3><p class=\"am-p\">Repeat a past donation, or speak a description, portions and pickup-by time. Edit extracted values before you publish.</p></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><div class=\"am-ico\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 22s7-6 7-12a7 7 0 0 0-14 0c0 6 7 12 7 12z\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"am-h3\">NGOs: claim what fits</h3><p class=\"am-p\">See eligible nearby donations with plain-language match reasons, claim all or part within a short confirmation window.</p></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><div class=\"am-ico\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21c1-4 4-6 8-6s7 2 8 6\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"am-h3\">Volunteers: toggle and go</h3><p class=\"am-p\">Mark availability and carrying capacity, accept a pickup, and confirm collection and handover with a single tap.</p></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><div class=\"am-ico\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7z\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"am-h3\">Admins: approve and watch</h3><p class=\"am-p\">Approve or suspend participants, monitor active rescues and resolve failed assignments before food is at risk.</p></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><div class=\"am-ico\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"am-h3\">CSR sponsors: see the proof</h3><p class=\"am-p\">Campaign recognition and a transparent dashboard of confirmed portions, estimated waste avoided and illustrative costs.</p></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><div class=\"am-ico\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M8 12l3 3 5-6\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"am-h3\">Donors: safe by default</h3><p class=\"am-p\">A fresh handling checklist covers preparation time, storage and allergens for every post. Saved preferences never reuse past safety declarations.</p></div> </div> </section> <section class=\"am-sec am-sec-alt\"> <div class=\"am-split\"> <div> <p class=\"am-eyebrow\">Donor flow</p> <h2>Publish in under a minute, with a checklist you can trust</h2> <p class=\"am-sub\">Voice or typing gets you started. If AI is unavailable, the manual form is one tap away and works just as well.</p> <div class=\"am-card\"> <div class=\"am-meta\">Food description</div> <div class=\"am-input\"><span>Dal makhani and roti, 24 portions</span><code>14:05</code></div> <div class=\"am-check\"> <div><span class=\"am-tick\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg></span>Prepared within 2 hours</div> <div><span class=\"am-tick\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg></span>Held hot above 63°C until pickup</div> <div><span class=\"am-tick\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg></span>Contains dairy, gluten</div> </div> <div style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\" class=\"am-row\"><span class=\"am-badge\">Optional photo added</span><a class=\"am-btn am-btn-p\" href=\"#\">Publish donation</a></div> </div> </div> <div> <p class=\"am-eyebrow\">Your impact</p> <h2>Numbers that only count when delivered</h2> <p class=\"am-sub\">Portions appear on the dashboard only after the receiving NGO confirms the quantity. Estimates are labelled as estimates.</p> <div class=\"am-card\"> <div class=\"am-row\"><span class=\"am-h3\">Confirmed portions, Q3</span><span class=\"am-badge\">Verified</span></div> <div class=\"am-stat\">42,380</div> <div class=\"am-bar\"><i style=\"width:68%\"></i></div> <p class=\"am-meta\">68% of this campaign goal · Updated <code>2025-09-14 18:42</code></p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\"am-sec\"> <p class=\"am-eyebrow\">Campaign recognition</p> <h2>Every sponsor's share, traceable end to end</h2> <p class=\"am-sub\">Each dashboard view ties back to confirmed handovers, so sponsors and partners can audit impact without a spreadsheet.</p> <div class=\"am-stats\"> <div class=\"am-card\"><span class=\"am-meta\">Portions delivered</span><div class=\"am-stat\">184,520</div><span class=\"am-badge am-badge-p\">Confirmed at handover</span></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><span class=\"am-meta\">Estimated waste avoided</span><div class=\"am-stat\">3.1 t</div><span class=\"am-badge\">Estimate, methodology published</span></div> <div class=\"am-card\"><span class=\"am-meta\">Illustrative cost savings</span><div class=\"am-stat\">₹ 9.2 L</div><span class=\"am-badge\">Illustrative only</span></div> </div> </section> <footer class=\"am-foot\"> <div class=\"am-brand\"><span class=\"am-logo\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M12 21c-5 0-8-3.5-8-8 4 0 8 2 8 8zM12 21c0-6 3-10 9-11 0 6-3 11-9 11z\"/></svg></span>Anna Mitra</div> <nav><a href=\"#\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#\">Terms</a><a href=\"#\">Food safety standards</a><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></nav> <span>© 2025 Anna Mitra</span> </footer> </div>",
